# COVID-19 Data Exploration

## 📌 Project Overview

This project explores COVID-19 case, death, population, and vaccination data using SQL Server to identify trends and calculate key analytical metrics.

## 🔍 Analysis Performed

- Analyzed total COVID-19 cases and deaths
- Calculated death percentage
- Calculated percentage of population infected
- Identified countries with the highest infection rates
- Compared total death counts across countries and continents
- Calculated global COVID-19 numbers
- Analyzed population vs. vaccinations
- Calculated rolling vaccination totals
- Calculated vaccination rates

## 🛠️ SQL Skills Used

- Joins
- Aggregate Functions
- CTEs
- Temporary Tables
- Window Functions
- Data Type Conversion
- Views
- GROUP BY
- CASE / Analytical Calculations

## 📁 Files

- SQLQuery1 First Project.sql – SQL queries used for data exploration
- CovidDeaths.xlsx – COVID-19 deaths and cases dataset
- CovidVaccinations.xlsx – COVID-19 vaccination dataset
